shape: Tapered Directional
camber type: Resort V3
camber description: Raised camber platform through inserts for dependable edge hold at high speeds on variable terrain, elevated contact points for enhanced float and stability in powder, traditional tip and tail arcs for seamless transitions
sidecut type: Radical Taper
sidecut description: Radial sidecut paired with Tapered Tail; narrower tail sinks in powder while wider nose floats above snow
width: Standard, Wide
mounting pattern: 2x4 Inserts
topsheet: Skinless Core Ash Woodgrain Topsheet - Digital Print
topsheet description: Specially treated pure wood veneer; less weight than traditional topsheets; PAM16000 printing with 16,000 inkjet nozzles using solventless water-based UV ink; includes hand screen printed silkscreened portion
laminate: Holysheet Tri/Bi and Magic Bean Resin with 4x25mm Carbonflax Amplifier
fiberglass description: Holysheet fiberglass with greater roving count without increasing weight; tri-axial above core and bi-axial underneath
resin: Magic Bean Resin (plant-based, high bio-content, zero waste, no greenhouse emissions)
carbon reinforcement: 4x25mm Carbonflax Amplifier (natural flax fibers combined with carbon strands)
core: Panda Hover Core
core materials: Paulownia, Poplar, Bamboo Power Rods
core description: Ultra lightweight, ultra responsive
base: Hyperdrive ADV XT Base with Moonshot Omni-Tune, Sublimation
base description: Premium sintered polyethylene with highest anti-friction levels due to high molecular mass; extra thick for enhanced durability
base structure: Moonshot Omni-Tune (race-base structure channeling water at 45-degree angle)
base graphics: Sublimation process for bold vibrant colors embedded into base material
board graphics note: Graphics are size dependent and cannot be swapped between sizes
terrain: Backcountry, all mountain, variable terrain, powder
riding style: All Mountain, Freeride, Backcountry
design philosophy: Compact design for quick and agile handling unlike traditional long/wide powder boards
